<title>FINLAND: PENOPE JAN-AUG PRE-TAX PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>PENOPE JAN-AUG PRE-TAX PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to Aug 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 1.12 vs 3.10</p>
